{"diagnosis": "Fetch test uses 256-word NOP memory (ADDI x0,x0,0 with opcode 7'b0010011) but trace shows TRAP: cpu trap asserted and tohost FAIL 0xdead. Expected is_alu_reg_imm to assert for mem_rdata_latched[6:0]==7'b0010011, but line 877 compares to 7'b0010001 so NOP never decodes as ALU-imm. The illegal decode causes the trap and stalls fetch progress.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -877,1 +877,1 @@
-			is_alu_reg_imm               <= mem_rdata_latched[6:0] == 7'b0010001;
+			is_alu_reg_imm               <= mem_rdata_latched[6:0] == 7'b0010011;
", "expected": "tohost PASS with no TRAP: cpu trap asserted"}

